  "body": "• Spacious three-bedroom home with study, separate toilet, and separate laundry\r\n• Large double garage and excellent storage\r\n• Established 810sqm (more or less) section with room to enhance and add value\r\n• Quiet cul-de-sac position just moments from the estuary\r\n• Walk to Orewa Beach, schools, shops, cafes, and restaurants\r\n• Well-presented with exciting potential to renovate, extend, or modernise over time\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac, this spacious and well-presented home offers an outstanding opportunity to enjoy a relaxed coastal lifestyle on a generous 810sqm (more or less) site. Just a stone's throw from the estuary and within easy walking distance of Orewa Beach, shops, schools, cafes, and restaurants, the location is hard to beat.\r\n\r\nInside, a large open-plan living, kitchen and dining room forms the heart of the home, complete with a cosy wood-burner and seamless indoor-outdoor flow to the impressive established gardens. The spacious and practical layout continues with three generous bedrooms, a dedicated study, a large family bathroom, separate toilet, and separate laundry. The expansive living spaces provide comfort and flexibility for families, professionals, or those seeking room to spread out, while the large double garage offers excellent storage and parking.\r\n\r\nBeautifully maintained and ready to enjoy as is, the property also presents exciting scope to update, renovate, or extend over time, adding further value and making the most of this sizeable section.\r\n\r\nSet amongst stunning established grounds, this is a home where you can embrace easy living on the flat, enjoy the coastal surroundings, and secure a property with both immediate appeal and future potential. With Orewa Beach, shops, schools, cafes, restaurants, and convenient transport links to the CBD all within easy reach, this is a location designed for both lifestyle and convenience.",
